# Rollback copies of the vendored FFmpeg / GDExtension binaries, kept beside the live ones whenever they
# are swapped (see the AV1 rebuild in STATE.md). Sixteen large files that duplicate whatever the previous
# release shipped — worth having on disk, never worth committing.
